---
/**
 * Two ways a model reaches the decoder worker, joined as early as possible.
 *
 * A published stage arrives by URL: `fetchModel` downloads it with progress and the Cache API
 * keeps it. A file from the reader's disk arrives through the picker: `readLocalModel` runs the
 * cheap checks (extension, size, `rukh_block`) and the bytes are transferred to the worker, with
 * no `fetch` and nothing cached. Inside the worker the two paths meet in one `??`, and everything
 * after it -- `createSession`, the contract that refuses logits that are not 2030 wide, the game --
 * is the same code. That is why the local model inherits every guard the published ones had.
 */
const label =
  'Dos caminos hasta el worker del decoder. Arriba, una etapa publicada llega por su URL del Hub: fetchModel la descarga y la caché la guarda. Abajo, tu fichero .onnx llega por el selector de ficheros: readLocalModel comprueba la extensión, el tamaño y lee rukh_block, y los bytes se transfieren al worker sin ninguna petición de red. Los dos caminos se unen en una sola línea, bytes o descarga, y a partir de ahí todo es el mismo código: createSession, el contrato que exige 2030 logits, y la partida.';
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 640 256" role="img" aria-label={label}>
  <g font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">
    <!-- published stage -->
    <rect x="10" y="20" width="150" height="48" fill="var(--box-fill)" stroke="var(--ink)"></rect>
    <text x="22" y="40">
      etapa publicada
    </text>
    <text x="22" y="57" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10">
      url del Hub
    </text>
    <rect x="190" y="20" width="160" height="48" fill="var(--box-fill)" stroke="var(--ink)"></rect>
    <text x="202" y="40">
      fetchModel
    </text>
    <text x="202" y="57" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10">
      descarga y caché
    </text>

    <!-- the reader's own file -->
    <rect x="10" y="146" width="150" height="48" fill="var(--box-fill)" stroke="var(--ink)"></rect>
    <text x="22" y="166">
      tu .onnx
    </text>
    <text x="22" y="183" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10">
      selector de ficheros
    </text>
    <rect x="190" y="140" width="160" height="60" fill="var(--box-fill)" stroke="var(--ink)"></rect>
    <text x="202" y="159">
      readLocalModel
    </text>
    <text x="202" y="175" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10">
      extensión, tamaño
    </text>
    <text x="202" y="190" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10">
      y rukh_block
    </text>

    <!-- arrows into the middle column -->
    <line x1="160" y1="44" x2="186" y2="44" stroke="var(--ink)"></line>
    <path d="M190 44 l-7 -4 v8 z" fill="var(--ink)"></path>
    <line x1="160" y1="170" x2="186" y2="170" stroke="var(--ink)"></line>
    <path d="M190 170 l-7 -4 v8 z" fill="var(--ink)"></path>

    <!-- the join -->
    <line x1="350" y1="44" x2="386" y2="98" stroke="var(--ink)"></line>
    <line
      x1="350"
      y1="170"
      x2="386"
      y2="118"
      stroke="var(--accent)"
      stroke-width="1.4"
      stroke-dasharray="5 3"
    ></line>
    <rect
      x="390"
      y="84"
      width="110"
      height="48"
      fill="var(--box-fill)"
      stroke="var(--accent)"
      stroke-width="1.6"
    ></rect>
    <text x="402" y="104">
      loadSession
    </text>
    <text x="402" y="121" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10">
      empalme: ??
    </text>

    <!-- everything after the join is shared -->
    <line x1="500" y1="108" x2="516" y2="108" stroke="var(--ink)"></line>
    <path d="M520 108 l-7 -4 v8 z" fill="var(--ink)"></path>
    <rect x="520" y="66" width="112" height="84" fill="var(--ink)" stroke="var(--ink)"></rect>
    <text x="530" y="88" fill="var(--paper)">
      createSession
    </text>
    <text x="530" y="108" fill="var(--paper)" font-size="10">
      contrato:
    </text>
    <text x="530" y="122" fill="var(--paper)" font-size="10">
      2030 logits
    </text>
    <text x="530" y="139" fill="var(--paper)" font-size="10">
      y la partida
    </text>

    <text x="190" y="222" fill="var(--accent-text-aa)" font-size="10">
      transferido al worker: sin fetch, sin caché, sin red
    </text>
    <line x1="10" y1="232" x2="630" y2="232" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="0.6"></line>
    <text x="10" y="249" fill="var(--muted)" font-size="10">
      desde el empalme, el mismo código para los dos: el fichero local hereda todas las guardas
    </text>
  </g>
</svg>
